149
00:07:07,660 --> 00:07:10,160
you chew every bite a hundred

150
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:12,160
times before you swallow it.

151
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:14,160
So, he would tell the students to do that.

152
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:18,160
And it slowed down conversation at dinner a great deal.

153
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,660
And he would tell them, that's

154
00:07:19,660 --> 00:07:21,160
what he's known for, among other things,

155
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:23,160
his theory of interest.

156
00:07:23,160 --> 00:07:26,160
So, this is what's talked about in your textbook.

157
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:29,160
And I wanted to start out

158
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:32,160
with Irving Fisher, because, by the way,

